          "oa:exact": "(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\n\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\n\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter."
        },
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextPositionSelector",
          "oa:start": 329,
