        "@value": "Unless all of the following hold: (i) the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; (ii) the firearm is unloaded; (iii) the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (iv) the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "rkaf:assertionPolarity": "rkaf:affirmed"
    },
